How to update image in ECS:
 - cluster -> service -> Teask defination -> Create New revision and update the latest Image there -> Save
 - Click on Deploy -> update service -> choose cluster -> Force New deployment -> Desired Task 1 from 0 -> Save

How to update image in EC2 when Docker is installed on top of that
 - Login to the server using Putty
 - ec2- user
 - sudo su -
 - ls -> docker-compose.yml
 - authenticate the docker-login, go to ECR and click on show pull image and choose the first url
 - Paste it to the server hit enter
 - edit the image here in this file the image will be updated
